# Placeholder so `bundle.resources` ("resources/pg/" -> "pg/") validates at
# build time even when no embedded Postgres tree is staged here.
#
# - .deb / dev builds: this dir holds ONLY this file → pg.rs::detect() finds
#   no pg/bin/postgres and takes Mode::System (system Postgres).
# - macOS / Windows / AppImage builds: the packaging scripts `rm -rf` this
#   dir and stage a real PG tree (bin/lib/share) here → Mode::Embedded.
#
# Do NOT commit a real PG tree here — it's fetched/built per-OS by
# packaging/embedded-postgres/*.
